    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo makiito'o ana ár i baraá tlawtá wa ti'imít. Xareemiwós a mibaangw nee sage ngi koon a faanqw. Nee gár gawaá xareemiwós a slam'i mibaangw. Nee gár gawaá sageerós a umér /ooslisliingw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiito'oodá' naa ár slaqsaywós a adór du'uma. Ya'aawós a adór kudá' makiito'ór ta babay duúbu. Afkós a adór kuduú diraangw. Dayshamoodá' úr makiito'oorí gari /uurií haniís, nee kitaangós oo aleesleemuwo, nee gari aleesleemuú yaariír i haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee sagós oo wák una ár a adór ságw taa tliqiís ar tliqsantá gwa'ara, ala inkahhayduú gwa'ara kwa hungu/uús. Yaamu sleémeero makiito'oodá' ngiri sa waa/oo/iyé', kari eeharahár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dayshamoodá' úr kuri sluufmiís asma adoodá' makiito'oodá' ngiwa aleesleemuú i haniís. Makiito'oodá' sleeme kari sluufmiís, tari káh, «Heé slaqás nee makiito'oorí a heemá? Nee slám heé makiito'oorí ga aleesláw slaqwaraaro a heemá?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiito'oodá' kari afkwí haniís oo /ayma'aá dara/aangw nee awa /ooslisliingw ngiwa axwes. Slám kari aleesleemií haniís oo gadiyeé ngiwa tlehh slahheeri mibeeri tsiyáhh nee tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiito'oodá' afa guri awátl, Mungú guri /ooslisliín, nee umuú Mungú sleeme, nee hotángw Mungú, nee tam kudá' sleémeero awa gawaá doorí wa hootá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám kari ya/án as iwa slaqw nee múk hhohhó' oo Mungú nee nguwa ar ba/. Aleesleemu guri sleér gawaá umuúqo tlahhaywo nee umuúqo muko nee tsifriro nee umuúqo xoorooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero oo baraá yaamuú wa hoót makiito'oodá' ka i tumbarara'aat, kudá' umer'ín taa gooiniká baraá kitaábuuduú slafiingw iimír iimu/úngw yaamuwo. Kitaábuuwí oo slafiingw oo Deelmoó bee/i, kudá' taa gaás.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé iiaá koóm i axaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee bar kwa tseegamór i gooín, aqo kun tseek. Nee hee bar kwa gaasár i gooín ar paánga, aqo kun gaas ar paánga. Baraá kaangwihe múk hhohhó' oo Mungú gár kuwa hariím a qitla nee haratlintaao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo makiito'ór hatlá' ngiri ár. Makiito'oorí i ti'imít yaamuú wa ale. Makiito'oorí xareemiwós a tsár, a adór xareemaá deelmoó bee/i. Makiito'oorí bir axwés afoorós a adór tidár dayshamoó úr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiito'oorí aleesleemuudá' sleémeero oo makiito'oodár geera gun ar gadiyús dír geeraá makiito'oodár geeraá wa ale. Makiito'oorí yaamu gina harakeemís, nee múk baraá yaamuú wa hoót sleémeero, as makiito'oodár geera kawa i tumbarara'ati. Tidá' tliqsantá gwa'ara gaa sleer, iri hungú/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiito'oodár tsár layaá uren gina tlehhít, tam asla gan aweerís gawaá doorí wa ale ay baraá yaamu, dír geeraá muu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee inós múk baraá yaamuú wa hoót gun paslimís ar layuuwós kudá' i tlehhit dír geeraá makiito'oodár geeraá wa ale. Inós mukdá' baraá yaamuú wa hoót gun babeer, «Murslaaqat tleehhaak oo slaqsoó makiito'oodá' taa inkaahhi'ií qaás ar paánga, nee iri male sláf.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiito'oodár tsár aleesleemu guri malé sleér oo murslaaqatuudá' nguwa hiinsluú i qas, as murslaaqatuudá' iwa axweesi, nee mukdá' sleémeero inós gwa sii' i tumbarara'ataro, kuwa tsu/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee inós muu sleémeero guri harakeemís kuwa layár i qaasi baraá dákw doó /iyayhe, laqaá gawaá gitsee/a. Múk urén nee oo ninakwe guri harakeemís, nee daqaare nee narkuute, múk lawaale nee kudá' lawaaleerooká sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slám hara'aya gari ó' as heé layaarí ga koomaaká, gaa mingiwa tlaáxw laqaá mingiwa weeriís. Layaarí an umuú makiito'oodá' laqaá faarór umuuwós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diirí an dír sagalooór slaa'. Heé fuqurángw koóm faarór makiito'oorí ngi faari. Asma faaroorós a faarór hee. Nee faaroorós a tsiire lahhoó' nee mibeeraá lahhoó' nee lahhoó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
